WEBVTT

00:00:18.231 --> 00:00:19.446
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Are you a lark?

00:00:20.271 --> 00:00:24.609
Do you jump out of bed early in the morning with a smile on your face?

00:00:25.339 --> 00:00:27.103
Or, are you an owl?

00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:30.178
Do you prefer to stay up late at night?

00:00:31.584 --> 00:00:37.201
Larks are at their best early in the day, and tend to go to bed earlier.

00:00:38.383 --> 00:00:43.311
Owls like to get up late and they are at their best late in the day.

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:49.612
However, it’s not just about what time you get up in the morning and go to bed at night.

00:00:50.707 --> 00:00:53.341
It’s about when you feel most active.